"gap_id":"gap_sec32_stat_strategy","missing_source_classes":["项目研究定义中仅说明无确证性假设检验，未区分主要与次要"],"target":"次要终点统计分析策略"}],"heading":"次要目的和次要终点","missing_source_classes":["项目未提供除安全性终点外的其他次要有效性终点定义","项目未提供次要终点的统计检验策略（是否设次要假设检验）"],"proposal_text":"本研究的次要终点为安全性与耐受性评价，具体包括：（1）不良事件（AE）与严重不良事件（SAE）发生率，观察窗口为首次给药至末次给药后28天；（2）生命体征、12导联心电图及临床实验室检查的异常发生率；（3）症状性低血压发生率。上述安全性终点旨在全面评估SGC-R21在慢性心力衰竭（HFrEF）受试者中的安全性特征与耐受性，为后续III期研究的安全性监测方案提供依据。安全性数据按安全性分析集（SAS）进行描述性汇总，不设确证性假设检验。","rationale":"项目已确认研究事实中明确列出安全性终点为AE/SAE发生率（至末次给药后28天）、生命体征/心电图/实验室检查异常发生率及症状性低血压发生率，并规定安全性按SAS描述、无确证性假设检验。需医学经理确认：上述安全性终点是否全部归入次要终点章节，或症状性低血压等是否应移至独立安全性章节；次要终点中是否还需纳入其他有效性指标（如6分钟步行距离、NYHA分级变化、NT-proBNP绝对变化等），当前来源未提供。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_372f340e144842d9","section_number":"3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a015977f6210f4b22f878978","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003051631_bfcf3261","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"恢复本章节正文与当前项目来源的证据绑定后重新核对。","category":"mapping_failed","gap_id":"gap:evidence-binding","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_ece5f50f748e42da"}],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节正文的当前项目直接来源"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本次输出未能把正文绑定到有效证据；需补充或重新绑定支持本章节的当前项目直接来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_ece5f50f748e42da","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a015977f6210f4b22f878978","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003051631_bfcf3261","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究：SGC-R21设低/中/高三个剂量组与安慰剂组平行对照，主要评价12周NT-proBNP较基线变化与安全性及耐受性。","quote_sha256":"542b01515fd9e237bf690a2150d8fdba396035e8f67be301275ac5454e1ee339","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"SGC-R21片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"5933c1a1045fa23c88cefc18589225bcc8b623a8108095fe8a368080a94130a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"各组按1:1:1:1随机；背景GDMT按指南维持稳定。","quote_sha256":"11703ae792bcf0472032409b93b3f1d9396929248ed8481b07f37fd9c946b598","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"筛选期（-28至-1天）；治疗期（第1天至第12周）；安全性随访期（末次给药后28天）","quote_sha256":"bd2c66fb1c011d6239bd55033e0b4ecc4371d8c2932778947261a7f5dff6072a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","quote":"筛选（V1，-28~-1天）、基线随机（V2，D1）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3–V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，W12）、末次给药后28天安全性随访（V8）。","quote_sha256":"dd63df4b3e66ae7ece55e746b97043dbd40d4385a8e4fccb4fbf1d3abe7c762d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","span_id":"es_007"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_003","es_004","es_005","es_006","es_007"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究。试验药物SGC-R21设低剂量（2.5mg）、中剂量（5mg）和高剂量（10mg）三个剂量组，与安慰剂组平行对照，各组按1:1:1:1比例随机分配。SGC-R21为口服薄膜衣片，每日一次，连续给药12周；安慰剂片外观与SGC-R21一致，口服每日一次×12周。背景指南导向药物治疗（GDMT）按指南维持稳定。研究时期分为筛选期（-28至-1天）、治疗期（第1天至第12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后28天）。访视安排为：筛选访视（V1，-28至-1天）、基线随机访视（V2，第1天）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3至V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，第12周）及末次给药后28天安全性随访访视（V8）。","rationale":"研究设计要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照、II期、三剂量组与安慰剂1:1:1:1、口服每日一次×12周、2.5/5/10mg、研究时期划分、访视策略）均直接来源于项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：随机化具体方法（区组大小、分层因素）及盲法维持操作细节未在来源中明确；V6（第12周门诊访视）与V7（治疗结束访视，第12周）是否为同一次访视需核实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_61e79b50a9044db8","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a015977f6210f4b22f878978","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003051631_bfcf3261","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_b